---
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate & Advertising Disclosure - IbadanSolarHub.com.ng"
  description="Learn about our affiliate relationships, advertising policies, and commitment to unbiased solar engineering recommendations."
>
  <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-12 border-b border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black">Affiliate Disclosure & Editorial Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 space-y-6">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>IbadanSolarHub.com.ng</strong>, our mission is to provide accurate, transparent, and actionable renewable energy information to homeowners, business managers, and technicians across Nigeria. We believe in complete transparency regarding how our platform is funded.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">2. Affiliate Relationships</h2>
        <p>
          We believe you should be able to tell, at a glance, which links on this site earn us money
          and which do not. Here is the complete and current list.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/60 p-4">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800 mb-1">
              Links that may earn us a commission
            </div>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm">
              <li>
                <strong>Earthbond</strong> — solar financing for businesses. If you apply through our
                referral link we may receive a referral fee. Their rates and terms are theirs, not ours,
                and we do not influence them.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Selar</strong> — our own digital guides and toolkits. This is our own product;
                you are buying directly from us.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600 mb-1">
              Links that do not earn us anything
            </div>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm">
              <li>
                <strong>Jumia and Konga price links.</strong> These are ordinary search links, provided
                so you can check current market prices yourself. We are <em>not</em> enrolled in an
                affiliate programme with either retailer, and we receive nothing when you click them.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Every other outbound link</strong> — manufacturer datasheets, standards bodies,
                research and news sources. Included because they support the analysis.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-4">
          Where a link does earn us a commission it costs you nothing extra, and we never let it change
          what we recommend. If a cheaper or better-suited product exists, we say so — including when
          that means recommending something we earn nothing from. If we ever join an affiliate programme
          for a retailer listed above, this page will be updated to say so before any link is changed.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
          This page reflects the live state of the site, and you can verify it yourself: third-party
          affiliate links (Earthbond) are marked <code class="text-xs">rel="sponsored nofollow noopener"</code>,
          and non-earning outbound retailer links are marked <code class="text-xs">rel="nofollow noopener"</code>.
          Right-click any link and inspect it. Links to our own products on Selar are not affiliate links,
          so they are not marked as such.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">3. Editorial Independence</h2>
        <p>
          Our technical reviews, battery cycle comparisons, inverter sizing recommendations, and installer evaluations are based solely on engineering merit, durability under Nigerian environmental conditions, and real-world customer satisfaction. We do not accept payment to give artificially positive ratings to defective or counterfeit hardware.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">4. Display Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          We may display banner advertisements served by third-party advertising networks (such as Google AdSense) or direct private sponsors. Sponsored placements are clearly marked with labels such as "Advertisement", "Sponsored", or "Partner Spotlight".
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or feedback regarding our affiliate relationships or disclosures, please contact us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="text-solar-700 font-bold hover:underline">{SITE.email}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
